   "question": "Find the exact value of $\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 e^{(\\ln 3)x}\\,dx$.",
   "answer": "$e^{(\\ln 3)x} = \\left(e^{\\ln 3}\\right)^x = 3^x$, so\n$$\\int_0^1 3^x\\,dx = \\left[\\frac{3^x}{\\ln 3}\\right]_0^1 = \\frac{3 - 1}{\\ln 3} = \\frac{2}{\\ln 3}.$$"
